WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:02.333
Let's go together.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.769
I'm an Exterminator, but...

00:00:05.041 --> 00:00:08.041
to be honest,
I can't help feeling afraid...

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.458
of living life alone.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.375
That's why I want you to be with me.

00:00:22.416 --> 00:00:23.541
I'll go with you.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.250
So, please... don't die.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.666
For His Excellency

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.916
-and the future of mankind!
-Damn it!

